<trk><name>Day 2 · Waterloo → Yamaska lake loop → Knowlton → Sutton (78.5 km)</name>
<desc>Custom Day 2 for Option 2: Les Matins de Victoria (Waterloo) to Parc national de la Yamaska lake circuit on bike-legal park cycleways (Piste Nord / Piste Sud), then south via Knowlton / Lac-Brome to Mont Sutton. Skips Bromont. Scrubbed off bicycle=no paths. Access-audited.</desc>
